Z||000000||Formula||10-08-2001||01:36 PM||||have any of you used the 3.4, 5.0 or 5.7 injectors?<P>It looks like my motor will need at least eh 19 lb but a lot of poeple say they run modded 3.4s on the 2.8 injectors.  So I should be able to run my heavily modded 3.2 on 3.4 injectors.  When I run this through the computer it only gets a 143 hp from the stock injectors, 180 hp from the 3.4 injectors (not bad  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> ), 200 hp from the 5.0 injectors and 230 hp from the 5.7 injectors.  I dont think I'll be able to flow enough air for the 5.7 24lb/hr injectors.  But with my ported and polished heads I should be able to run the 5.0 injectors.  <P>I want to get at least near 200 hp with injectors, a big bore throttle body and am adjustable fuel pressure regulator.<P>motor has high compression, and a big cam.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Formula_sigx21.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000001||Alex4mula||10-08-2001||02:24 PM||||Whatever injector you choose other than stock 2.8 get a new PROM calibrated for it to avoid problems at WOT and for maximum performance.||||reg||1
